Output demos/claude-code-demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme { "name": "monokai", "background": "#0C0C0C" }
Set TypingSpeed 20ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.4

Hide
Type "cd /Users/alex/projects/pi_agent_rust && clear"
Enter
Show

Type "echo '=== pi-rust terraphim-router: Intelligent Model Selection ==='"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "/tmp/route_demo"
Enter
Sleep 8s

Type "echo '=== Skill automatically routes to optimal provider/model ==='"
Enter
Sleep 1s
